/// SELECTION_ELEMENT Block object contains information about a selection
/// element, including the selection status. Use the MaxResults parameter to
/// limit the number of blocks that are returned. If there are more results
/// than specified in MaxResults , the value of NextToken in the operation
/// response contains a pagination token for getting the next set of
